      "message": "[warning] Line 86: 🟡 When switching `rendersUpright` to `false`, pending upright work is not cleared (`pendingUpright`/`uprightScheduled`). A previously queued transformed frame can still be enqueued after PiP stop/failure, causing stale orientation output and unnecessary work. Clear pending state when disabling upright mode (and ensure in-flight drain observes the disabled state).",
